WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:03.770
Some of them, and some of them are normally
running for the train here.

2
00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:06.550
So they tend to come and get their coffee
and then run away.

3
00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:09.450
But most of the time, there are people who
sit here

4
00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:11.450
and they talk to us whilst we're making
their coffee.

5
00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:15.560
Sometimes after 2, 3 p.m., they tend to die
out a little bit.

6
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:19.080
So some of the customers do come in for a
chat and coffee.

7
00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:20.500
He was telling me about...

8
00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.500
He's doing a show later tonight, and he got
some coffee.

9
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.550
So, yeah, he was telling me about that.

10
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.400
And then we exchanged names

11
00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.050
because he might be here often.

12
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:31.650
And, yeah, that happened.
